# Allowlist for Dockerfile.rust (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` before `.dockerignore`):
# only what the build copies, never `target/`, the Python tree or local state.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!rustfmt.toml
!clippy.toml
!crates/
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/target
